PATCH SCOPE
===========

Patch scope:

- Add only `audit` to active EvidenceItem.kind.
- Normalize only the NeedleRuntime audit evidence object to active
  EvidenceItem fields.
- Keep `needle_runtime` as trace_refs.kind only.
- Keep artifact_type Mapping deferred and separate.
- Preserve GT, Root, DRS, Transition Matrix, DRS lifecycle, Negative Trace,
  and Marennya boundaries.

The patch does not add `needle_runtime`, `executor_node`,
`fractal_dag_executor_node`, or global artifact vocabulary terms to
EvidenceItem.kind.


